### Lire la config LLM du workspace
GET {{api_url}}/api/workspaces/a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890/llm-config
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Modifier la config LLM du workspace
PUT {{api_url}}/api/workspaces/a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890/llm-config
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "baseUrl": "https://api.mistral.ai/v1",
  "apiKey": "your-mistral-api-key",
  "model": "mistral-small-latest"
}
